{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19268","headline":"晚岁登武陵城顾望水陆怅然有作 · 刘禹锡","name":"晚岁登武陵城顾望水陆怅然有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星象承乌翼，蛮陬想犬牙。\n俚人祠竹节，仙洞闭桃花。\n城基历汉魏，江源自賨巴。\n华表廖王墓，菜地黄琼家。\n霜轻菊秀晚，石浅水纹斜。\n樵音绕故垒，汲路明寒沙。\n清风稍改叶，卢橘始含葩。\n野桥过驿骑，丛祠发逈笳。\n跳鳞避举网，倦鸟寄行楂。\n路尘高出树，山火远连霞。\n夕曛转赤岸，浮霭起苍葭。\n轧轧渡水桨，连连赴林鸦。\n呌阍道非远，赐环期自赊。\n孤臣本危涕，乔木在天涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}